! Welcome to ESUG

The European Smalltalk User Group (ESUG) is a non-profit user organization that supports all kinds of initiatives around the Smalltalk programming language. ESUG is supporting especially free-open source actions that benefit the whole Smalltalk community. For example ESUG:

- Connects all individual and corporate users of the Smalltalk programming language dialects and environments in Europe, 
- Promotes the teaching, learning and using of Smalltalk 
- Supports publishing and sharing books
- Supports local users groups and establishment of new ones
- Supports exchange and collaboration between students, researchers, innovators and practitioners
- Organizes a yearly conference, school and workshop 
- Sponsors other Smalltalk events


!! Support us

Check our sponsoring actions (visit lab, books, summer schools, user groups)

